  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ImplementationGuide heartland.fhir.us.protocol</b></p><a name=\"heartland.fhir.us.protocol\"> </a><a name=\"hcheartland.fhir.us.protocol\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: en</p></div><h2>HeartlandProtocolIG</h2><p>The official URL for this implementation guide is: </p><pre>https://fhir.heartlandprotocol.org/ImplementationGuide/heartland.fhir.us.protocol</pre><div><p>Draft FHIR R4 educational implementation-support specification for the HEARTLAND ecosystem. Profiles, extensions, questionnaires and synthetic examples support technical evaluation; clinical validation, vendor interoperability and full Toolkit V3.4 workflow coverage are not established.</p>\n</div></div>"
